		Bestiary: {
			MysteriousGentleman: A pale man in a fine suit who appears on lonely roads at night. His eyes are the colour of plum blossoms... or blood. Some say he offers power to those who ask.
			SandDemon: It swims through desert sand at night and spits grit into its prey's eyes.
			MantisDemon: Its arms have grown into scything blades. It waits among the jungle leaves.
			DrownedDemon: A demon that hid from the sun beneath the waves and rises only at night.
			HellfireDemon: It fled the sun all the way down to the Underworld, and learned to love the flames.
			HollowDemon: Its eyes are empty pits. The corruption of the land has seeped into its blood.
			FrostbittenDemon: Too numb with cold to feel pain, it never stops walking.
			MirrorDemon: Its body is a shattered mirror that scatters light into dizzying beams.
			Mukago: Lower Moon Four. A frightened demon who fights like a cornered animal.
			Kyogai: The former Lower Moon Six. Each beat of the drums in his body spins the room around you.
			Kaigaku: The new Upper Moon Six. A Thunder Breathing swordsman who chose to become a demon, wreathed in black lightning.
			Nakime: The new Upper Moon Four, mistress of the Infinity Castle. Every note of her biwa reshapes the world around you.
			LesserDemon: A starving, newly turned demon. Alone it is weak, but there are always more of them after dark.
			HornedDemon: A demon that has eaten enough people to grow horns and powerful legs. It pounces on anything that moves.
			SwampDemon: It swims through the earth as if it were water, and drags its prey under.
			TemariDemon: Plays a deadly game of catch with temari balls that bounce off every wall.
			ArrowDemon: Its eyes in its palms see every direction; its arrows of blood rarely miss.
			DrumDemon: Drums grow out of its body. Each beat sends a shockwave ringing through the caves.
			SpiderDemon: A member of a false 'family' of spiders. It spits webs and waits for its prey to stop struggling.
			TongueDemon: A floating head with a lashing tongue that slides through rock as easily as air.
			BloodBrute: A mountain of muscle swollen with a stronger demon's blood.
			BiwaDemon: Sent through a sliding door by the note of a biwa, from a castle that cannot be found.
			IceDemon: One of Doma's frozen servants. Its breath freezes the lungs of anyone who inhales it.
			SickleDemon: Hurls spinning sickles made of its own poisoned blood.
			FleshCrawler: A burrowing mass of flesh and teeth from deep underground.
			ThunderDemon: A swordsman who chose to become a demon. Black thunder crackles along his blade.
			VaseFish: A fish with too many arms, spat out of one of Gyokko's vases.
			EmotionClone: One of Hantengu's emotions given its own body. Cut one down and another takes its place.
			IceDoll: A small copy of Doma made of ice. It fights with all of his techniques.
			HandDemon: A demon made of arms, trapped on a wisteria-ringed mountain for decades, feeding on the candidates of the Final Selection.
			Rui: Lower Moon Five. A child-like demon who controls threads as sharp as steel, desperate for a 'family' bound by fear.
			Enmu: Lower Moon One. He drags his victims into dreams, and kills them in their sleep.
			GyutaroDaki: Upper Moon Six: a brother and sister who share one rank. Flying obi sashes and sickles of poisoned blood.
			Gyokko: Upper Moon Five. An 'artist' who hides inside his vases and fills the air with water and fish.
			Hantengu: Upper Moon Four. A cowering old demon who splits into the emotions that fight for him.
			Akaza: Upper Moon Three. A martial artist who has trained for centuries and only respects the strong.
			Doma: Upper Moon Two. A smiling cult leader with golden fans and a breath that freezes.
			Kokushibo: Upper Moon One. A former Demon Slayer who uses Moon Breathing; every slash sheds crescent moons.
			Muzan: The Demon King, and the first demon. Every demon's blood is his. Kill him and it ends.
		}

